---
title: "process_withdrawals (Osaka Fork - Ethereum Execution Specification)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_iter: for i, wd in enumerate(withdrawals)
    q_iter --> q_trie_set: trie_set(withdrawals_trie, rlp.encode(i), rlp.encode(wd))
    q_trie_set --> q_modify: modify_state(state, wd.address, increase_balance)
    q_modify --> q_iter: next withdrawal
    q_iter --> [*]: all withdrawals processed
    note right of q_iter
        INV-001: Withdrawal amounts are scaled by 10^9 (Gwei to Wei conversion)
        INV-002: Balance is always increased, never decreased
    end note
